AltoMultiChainlinkLendingOracle::updateChainlinkNodes()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── when _chainlinkNodes is valid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when _chainlinkNodes array is empty
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoMultiChainlinkLendingOracleInvalidInput
│   ├── when _chainlinkNodes contains invalid node
│   │   ├── when node feed is zero address
│   │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   │   ├── when node stalePeriod is zero
│   │   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   │   └── when node inDecimals + outDecimals is greater than 54
│   │       └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   └── when _chainlinkNodes is valid
│       ├── when updating with single node
│       │   ├── it should emit SetChainlinkNodes event with old and new nodes
│       │   ├── it should replace all existing nodes
│       │   └── it should update chainlinkNodes array correctly
│       ├── when updating with multiple nodes
│       │   ├── it should emit SetChainlinkNodes event with old and new nodes
│       │   ├── it should replace all existing nodes
│       │   └── it should update chainlinkNodes array correctly
│       └── when reducing the number of nodes
│           ├── it should emit SetChainlinkNodes event with old and new nodes
│           ├── it should replace all existing nodes
│           └── it should update chainlinkNodes array correctly